      {
        "id": "model-predicates",
        "moduleId": "query-filtering",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "comparison",
        "title": "WHERE谓词使用速查",
        "markdown": "| 场景 | 推荐谓词 | 示例 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 精确匹配 | `=` | `WHERE Sdept = 'CS'` |\n| 范围查询 | `BETWEEN` | `WHERE Sage BETWEEN 20 AND 23` |\n| 多值匹配 | `IN` | `WHERE Sdept IN ('CS','MA')` |\n| 模糊匹配 | `LIKE` | `WHERE Sname LIKE '刘%'` |\n| 空值判断 | `IS NULL` | `WHERE Grade IS NULL` |\n| 复合条件 | `AND` / `OR` | `WHERE Sdept='CS' AND Sage<20` |",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-filtering"
          ]
        }
